["rect",160,0,960,720,9227974,100],
["text","FILLETS",506,68,45,0],
["text","...more than the FISH MEAT",489,108,21,0],
["text","The next pages will show you how to control your fish, what you can do with them and what is harmful.",243,170,16.5,0],
["text","(C) 1998 Altar interactive, s.r.o.",515,420,16.5,0],
